-- C5-1: the rest of stock (plan §4.6: stock requests, vendors, purchases
-- and their lines, waste entries) and tasks, assets, repairs and attendance
-- (§4.7), kept by Q12 to Q15's defaults.
--
-- Generated by `prisma migrate dev --create-only` against the local cnc_db,
-- then the hand-written part appended below the line: CHECKs that hold each
-- record to the shapes the staff app allows, and the partial unique index
-- that allows one open shift per person. `prisma migrate diff
-- --from-config-datasource --to-schema prisma/schema.prisma --script`
-- prints an empty migration once this is applied.
--
-- The SR, PR, W, T and MT sequences already exist (C3 core). No table here
-- is append-only by trigger: the plan names only the audit log, the
-- approvals ledger and stock movements, and the history tables below are
-- only ever added to by their services.
--
-- Applied to CNC staging by hand with `migrate deploy` before the merge that
-- needs it, on the founder's go-ahead (docs/conventions.md, Data and
-- migrations). It reads and writes nothing of TAY's.

